From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: glacier <hyouga.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 06:42:21 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Deobfuscate NMS members using MCP mappings

Rename residual obfuscated members (a, b, ...) to human-readable MCP
(Mod Coder Pack) names via type-aware source remapping (Mercury), so the
generated NMS source is readable while remaining fully compilable.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>

